['Midnight Edge','午夜留白感','夜晚去画廊或 livehouse，安静疏离，低对比度妆容。轮廓藏在暗处，只有转动头部时骨骼光影才显现。','A late gallery visit or a live show. Quiet, low-contrast definition reveals itself as the face turns into the light.','减少大面积深色修容，用明暗对比，重点放在眼窝和下颌拐点的定点阴影。','Replace broad dark contour with small, deliberate shadows at the eye crease and jaw turn.','眼窝轻压冷灰棕；下颌角小范围定点修容；鼻尖、下巴点式提亮。','Wash cool taupe into the crease, shade a small area at the jaw turn and place tiny highlights on the nose and chin.',['Match Stix Contour Skinstick','Fenty Icon Velvet Liquid Lipstick','Eaze Drop Lightweight Blurring Skin Tint']]
